        {
          "text": "Nuko rero, mwana w’umuntu, uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, ati Barira ibisīga vy’amoko yose, n’ibikōko vyose vyo mw ishamba, uti Ni mukoranire hamwe, muze; mwikoranirize hamwe muvuye impande zose, muze ku kimazi canje mbacumitiye, ikimazi gihambaye ku misozi y’i Bgisirayeli, kugira ngo murye inyama, munywe amaraso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
